{"id":"663496","name":"红尖椒炒豆芽","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/663496/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆芽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红尖椒","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱段","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红尖椒，小葱洗净待用。","img":"images/663496/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"收红尖椒切成丝，蒜蓉。","img":"images/663496/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小葱切段。","img":"images/663496/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"绿豆芽洗净。","img":"images/663496/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中加入适量的食用油烧热，下入绿豆芽。","img":"images/663496/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"快速翻炒后加入红椒丝。","img":"images/663496/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量的料酒、盐、快速翻炒。","img":"images/663496/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入蒜蓉继续翻炒。","img":"images/663496/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入小葱段、鸡精翻炒出锅。","img":"images/663496/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将菜盛入盘中。","img":"images/663496/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}